init.description:
{robot}: {zone_count} zone(s) have no name yet. Enter one per line as `id=Name`. Zone IDs to name: {zone_ids}

The names are yours and stay in Home Assistant — you are not renaming anything in the iRobot app, and nothing here is sent to your robot.

Not sure which zone is which? Open this robot's map image (`image.{robot_slug}_rooms_map`): unnamed zones are drawn with their number on them, next to rooms you will recognise.

dock_contact_health.description:
The robot is reporting dock contact issues:

- Contact chatters: {chatters}
- Knockoffs (unintended undocking): {knockoffs}
- Charge aborts: {aborts}{smberr_context}

**Recommended actions:**
1. Clean the charging contacts on the robot and dock with a dry cloth.
2. Ensure the dock is on a flat, stable surface.
3. If knockoffs are high, check for obstructions near the dock.
